	<h2>Description</h2>

<p></p><center><iframe loading="lazy" title="YouTube video player" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/OeMab58WDF4" width="640" height="525" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe></center>
<p><img decoding="async" class="hero-cover aligncenter" src="https://www.yamaha.com/us/pianos/images/u-series-main-43e8e081.jpg" srcset="https://www.yamaha.com/us/pianos/images/b-series-4k.jpg 4x"></p>
<p>Yamaha’s b Series features pianos in a range of heights, widths, and depths. The b1 and b2 boast slender profiles, making them ideal for small spaces. With its larger dimensions and heavier construction, the b3 upright requires a little more room but brings a rich, far-reaching sound.</p>
<p> </p>
<h3 style="text-align: center;">Small Space, Big Sound</h3>
<p><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter" src="https://www.yamaha.com/us/pianos/images/frame-4.jpg" alt="Closeup of soundboard and ribs with Yamaha logo (three intersecting tuning forks)."></p>
<div class="uk-margin">The b Series takes its inspiration from our popular U-series with soundboards and ribs crafted from premium tone woods and fine spruce. The result is pianos with a tone that performs far beyond the entry level.</div>
<div></div>
<p> </p>
<h3 style="text-align: center;">Specially Designed Hammers</h3>
<div>
<p><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter" src="https://www.yamaha.com/us/pianos/images/u-hammers.jpg" alt="Rows of installed hammers on an upright piano being built."></p>
<div class="uk-margin">b Series hammers are crafted of the finest materials and painstakingly designed for each model to provide optimum tone, response and a lifetime of musical enjoyment.</div>
</div>
<div></div>
<p> </p>
<h3 class="heading" style="text-align: center;">Quality Components, Quality Sound</h3>
<div class="clearfix">
<div class="media-box media-image pull-left"><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" class="img-responsive images aligncenter" src="https://usa.yamaha.com/files/BC5841174F864F5687DF3F266B819CDB_12083_240x147_ebb288ebc926671e21a4bb76164285f2.jpg" alt="" width="478" height="293"></div>
<p class="description">Supported by four sturdy wooden back posts and a strong cast iron frame, b Series pianos are endowed with Yamaha’s renowned pure, clear tone. High-grade hammers and a proven action design offer effortless playing and a highly responsive keyboard ‘touch’ that make these uprights ideal for beginning players.</p>
</div>
<p> </p>
<h3 style="text-align: center;">Advanced V-Pro Frame</h3>
<p><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter" src="https://www.yamaha.com/us/pianos/images/YCA18-U1-016-066_0299.jpg"></p>
<div class="uk-margin">Yamaha was the first company to use an advanced Vacuum Shield Mold casting technology called V-Pro to create a stronger, lighter, more durable frame. Every b Series piano features a full-perimeter frame built to our exacting specifications at our Iwata Forge in Japan.</div>
<div></div>
<p> </p>
<h3 class="heading" style="text-align: center;">Affordable Quality</h3>
<div class="clearfix">
<div class="media-box media-image pull-left"><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" class="img-responsive images aligncenter" src="https://usa.yamaha.com/files/D834F9E21E0145498BBDD8F94F93FC64_12083_240x179_14ad01fcdd2ec3fbac9f3de5d9eff411.jpg" alt="" width="559" height="417"></div>
<p class="description">Produced at a Yamaha factory in Indonesia from a scale design developed in Japan, b Series pianos are Yamaha’s most affordable entry-level uprights. Although reduced production costs allow budget-friendly prices, Yamaha makes no compromises in the materials and workmanship that go into these exceptional uprights.</p>
</div>
<p> </p>
<h3 style="text-align: center;">Hand-Wound Brass Strings</h3>
<p><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter" src="https://www.yamaha.com/us/pianos/images/bass-strings.jpg" alt="A man smiling as he plays from sheet music on a Yamaha upright piano in his living room."></p>
<div class="uk-margin">Yamaha artisans in our factory in Kakegawa, Japan oversee the winding of pure copper and adjust the balance and tension of each bass string to the exacting standards and sound profile of every b Series piano.</div>
<div></div>
<p> </p>
<h3 style="text-align: center;">The Worlds First Aluminum Action Rail</h3>
<div>
<p><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter" src="https://www.yamaha.com/us/pianos/images/center-rail.jpg" alt="Closeup of the aluminum rail in a piano being built."></p>
<div class="uk-margin">Often copied but never equaled, the patented Yamaha aluminum action rail helps assure our piano keyboards are resistant to tiny fluctuations in humidity and temperature over time.</div>
</div>
<p> </p>
<h3>Links to Specs</h3>
<p><a href="/b-series-specs/">b Series Specs</a></p>
